# WeWritePublish 必需 / 可选配置 (与 Plugin/WeWriteCore/config.env.example 一致)
# 获取方式: https://mp.weixin.qq.com → 设置与开发 → 基本配置

# ---- 必需 -------------------------------------------------------------------
WECHAT_APPID=
WECHAT_SECRET=

# ---- 可选 -------------------------------------------------------------------
# 默认署名 (优先级: 调用参数 > WECHAT_AUTHOR > WEWRITE_AUTHOR)
WECHAT_AUTHOR=
WEWRITE_AUTHOR=

# 默认排版主题
WEWRITE_DEFAULT_THEME=professional-clean
